      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW GERTRUDE (4) hit the ground running off the inside draw with a fast early sectional but run over late and missed the frame when a 2.75 lengths fourth (26.16) over 460m at Geelong. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from six starts. Should bounce back. SECRET JOKER (3) shapes well after a sharp run last time, finishing second in a Grade 4/5 at Warrnambool in 25.26. Rates a leading chance if runs up to latest. BLUE TROMBONE (1) turned in a moderate effort last time when fifth at Sandown over 715m behind Derry (42.71) in a Grade 4/5. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Can figure in the finish. BROTHER DOOM (2) was strongly fancied last time but finished seventh (20.94) at Goulburn, bringing a two-run winning streak to an end. Comes out of a solid form race last start.",
